The provided Wikipedia page about Swiss cantons does not contain any data on population with migration background by canton. The page includes canton-level data on **population, area, official languages, Ständerat seats, and population density**, but migration background statistics are not present in this source.

You would need to consult the **Swiss Federal Statistical Office (BFS)** at admin.ch, which publishes detailed migration and foreign population data broken down by canton.

